{
  "about": "M31 「自定义服务」 with a service on the internet (作者 2026-11-24, prototype 「第五版 网上的地址」) in a real window. Run only with the debug-bridge custom-service-acceptance example: a throwaway tiny seed library, memory credentials, and a loopback stand-in that takes what is meant for https://api.example.com; the Agent's run goes through the real model transport to it. No real service, key or model. The cell under the four providers is 「自定义服务」; an address on the internet shows the key field at once (no 「加 Key」); without the key the service refuses; with it the form asks for a model name instead of listing; connected, the cell and the menu use the host; one sentence is answered; Settings → 模型与 API shows the service with 「改地址」「编辑密钥」「测试连接」「断开」 and 「测试连接」 says 可用; Settings → Agent lists the service by its host. Secondary display. Screenshots are records, not visual acceptance.",
  "steps": [
    { "launch": { "env": { "DRIFTING_WINDOW_DISPLAY": "secondary" } } },
    { "app": "ui.wait", "params": { "until": "ready", "timeout_ms": 30000 } },
    { "app": "window.focus" },
    { "app": "ui.press", "params": { "label": "展开右侧栏" } },
    { "app": "ui.wait", "params": { "until": "ready", "state": { "/right/open": true } } },
    { "app": "ui.find", "params": { "label": "DeepSeek" } },
    { "app": "ui.find", "params": { "label": "自定义服务", "count": 1 }, "note": "The cell under the four providers, after the hairline." },
    { "app": "ui.find", "params": { "label": "本地模型", "absent": true } },
    { "app": "ui.screenshot", "png": "01-cells.png" },
    { "app": "ui.press", "params": { "label": "自定义服务" } },
    { "app": "ui.find", "params": { "label": "加 Key", "role": "Button", "count": 1, "timeout_ms": 10000 }, "note": "Empty, the key field is folded behind 「加 Key」." },
    { "app": "input.type", "params": { "text": "https://api.example.com/v1" } },
    { "app": "ui.find", "params": { "label": "加 Key", "role": "Button", "absent": true }, "note": "On the internet: the key field is there by itself." },
    { "app": "ui.screenshot", "png": "02-internet-address.png" },
    { "app": "ui.press", "params": { "label": "连接", "role": "Button" } },
